{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“可能只是想有人陪”进一步解释成“怕孤单到连受过的气也肯再受”，比X更替人物下判断，少了一点心理上的暧昧和留白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键句有明确视觉落点，短句和重点加亮让观众不必逐字读完，也能抓住每段发生了什么；感受词按音乐进程出现，又避免了一次性堆满屏幕。更重要的是，Y把怀念、抗拒、亲近带来的温暖、温暖消退后的孤单，以及最终带着想念继续生活的过程串得更清楚，身体动作、声音和情绪变化也更具体，听音乐时更容易感受到人物内心细微的反复。X的叙述比较自然流畅，但右侧感受词有时像并列的情绪标签，观众需要自己补足它们与人物经历之间的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "36925fb2-4c34-4b9d-906b-53869a86312e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T195049238965Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:52:38.941691+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "52f7e36c5cd232e96c808ec25b3767996cb883686f0b66093c4e548be0a96b5b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308